  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 401.28 Slalom course",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 401.28 “Slalom course” means flags or markers set up in a wavy or zig-zag course in which a water-skier moves around behind a boat.\n\nSource. #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 401.211); ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13",
